      "zh": {
        "title": "國防部偵獲共機與共艦等共十三機艦在台海周邊活動",
        "summary": "國防部自14日至15日偵獲共機4架次與共艦8艘及公務船1艘",
        "body": [
          "中華民國國防部表示，自2026年8月14日上午6時至15日上午6時為止，偵獲共機4架次、共艦8艘及公務船1艘，共計13架次及艘持續在台海周邊活動。其中，有3架次軍機逾越海峽中線，進入台灣北部、中部及東部空域。",
          "根據國防部公布的示意圖，國軍於14日白天在台灣海峽空域偵獲中共無人機及直升機，其中1架直升機逾越中線。此外，國防部亦於當晚在防空識別區北部空域及東部空域，各偵獲1架中共直升機。國軍對此運用任務機、任務艦及岸置飛彈系統進行嚴密監控與應處。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Taiwan MND Detects 13 PLA Aircraft and Vessels Around Taiwan Strait",
        "summary": "Taiwan detects four PLA aircraft, eight naval vessels, and one official ship nearby",
        "body": [
          "Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense (MND) announced that four PLA aircraft, eight Chinese naval vessels, and one official ship were detected operating around the Taiwan Strait from 6:00 a.m. on August 14 to 6:00 a.m. on August 15, 2026. Among them, three aircraft crossed the median line of the Taiwan Strait or entered Taiwan's northern, central, and eastern airspace.",
          "According to the flight path map released by the MND, the military detected two PLA UAVs and helicopters in the Taiwan Strait, with one crossing the median line. Additionally, single PLA helicopters were spotted in the northern and eastern Air Defense Identification Zone (ADIZ) on Friday evening. Taiwan's armed forces monitored the activities using mission aircraft, naval vessels, and land-based missile systems."
        ]
      },
